   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜と: natural result",
     "texto": [
      "With a dictionary-form verb + **と**, you present a result that happens normally or automatically: **ボタン を おす と、 ドア が あきます** (when you press the button, the door opens). It is also used to give directions: **みぎ に まがる と、 えき が あります**.",
      "In this use, avoid an order or a request in the second part."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Careful: it isn't a request",
     "texto": [
      "**と** doesn't make a request: don't say «**〜と ください**». To ask for something, use **〜て ください**.",
      "To say that something happens every year: **はる に なる と、 さくら が さきます** (in spring, the cherry trees bloom)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
